ectual challenges</strong>: Earn a reputation among the port\u2019s people through challenging games of Ajedreina and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand your empire</strong>: Grow your fleet of ships, establish trade routes, acquire precious goods from the New World, and dominate transatlantic trade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in history</strong>: Experience trade in 16th-century Seville with a detailed recreation of the city\u2019s port and its inhabitants.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail on an adventure, take the helm of your destiny, and build your commercial empire in <i>Galleons of Fortune</i>!</p>","developers":["Grupo Axertia","Carrera de Indias"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626930/4d2ab67e56ef775747e7abdc0c8cca19d8366790/header.jpg?t=1764255708","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Carrera de Indias @ 2025","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3626930/1018347188/536fc038e9e64eac8fb2df945d4cf3ddda27befd/1763739730/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763740363","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3626930/1018347188/536fc038e9e64eac8fb2df945d4cf3ddda27befd/1763739730/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763740363","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3626930/1018347188/536fc038e9e64eac8fb2df945d4cf3ddda27befd/1763739730/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763740363","id":257235884,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257235884/8896df52daaf4beed50c87a63847f151b6e80a0c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763740363"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3626930/1832187699/fd4cecc1cca542ad05a3e670790a0165a549bc6c/1763919370/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764231930","dash_h264":"https://video.ak